1
00:00:11,416 --> 00:00:13,083
When two people meet,

2
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:16,375
and there's a spark,

3
00:00:20,083 --> 00:00:21,708
they start testing the waters.

4
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:25,817
They want to know
how the other feels,

5
00:00:28,862 --> 00:00:31,114
without giving
themselves away

6
00:00:32,958 --> 00:00:34,250
too soon.

7
00:00:38,583 --> 00:00:40,083
Everyone

8
00:00:41,916 --> 00:00:43,708
keeps their feelings hidden.

9
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,375
But if they're brave enough,

10
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:51,791
they'll show the truth

11
00:00:53,208 --> 00:00:54,708
to the one they love.

12
00:00:59,833 --> 00:01:00,958
True love

13
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:03,958
brings two people

14
00:01:10,111 --> 00:01:11,738
closer together.

15
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:21,666
Everyone loves differently.

16
00:01:24,125 --> 00:01:26,500
Some act like
they don't care,

17
00:01:28,166 --> 00:01:29,333
when really,

18
00:01:30,958 --> 00:01:32,333
they care the most.

19
00:01:35,541 --> 00:01:38,208
Love like that
is easy to miss.

20
00:01:40,625 --> 00:01:41,541
But...

21
00:01:44,791 --> 00:01:45,833
the right person

22
00:01:46,875 --> 00:01:48,250
will always see it.

23
00:01:53,750 --> 00:01:55,000
Then there are those

24
00:01:57,791 --> 00:02:00,625
who never say
how they feel.

25
00:02:01,625 --> 00:02:03,333
They keep it all inside

26
00:02:07,041 --> 00:02:09,125
and never ask

27
00:02:14,291 --> 00:02:15,375
how the other feels.

28
00:02:18,458 --> 00:02:19,250
Hello?

29
00:02:20,098 --> 00:02:21,516
Hello?

30
00:02:21,516 --> 00:02:23,184
You with me?

31
00:02:24,853 --> 00:02:27,147
Lisa approved
our bracelet idea.

32
00:02:27,147 --> 00:02:29,899
We're good to go!

33
00:02:34,154 --> 00:02:34,946
Oh.

34
00:02:35,572 --> 00:02:37,782
Go grab some lunch.

35
00:02:37,782 --> 00:02:40,618
We'll go over
the details after.

36
00:02:41,208 --> 00:02:41,875
Let's go.

37
00:03:04,434 --> 00:03:06,477
Why didn't you say anything?

38
00:03:10,148 --> 00:03:11,441
If I do now,

39
00:03:12,275 --> 00:03:14,027
is it too late?

40
00:03:42,347 --> 00:03:43,139
Hey!

41
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:50,688
Bad day?

42
00:03:50,688 --> 00:03:52,148
What's it to you?

43
00:04:02,784 --> 00:04:03,868
What are you doing?

44
00:04:03,868 --> 00:04:05,453
I'm filming this.

45
00:04:05,453 --> 00:04:09,540
Your meltdown
went viral last time.

46
00:04:15,338 --> 00:04:17,966
Sorry. I was kidding.

47
00:04:26,432 --> 00:04:28,184
(Elevator doors closing)
You show everything.

48
00:04:29,102 --> 00:04:30,728
In this business,

49
00:04:32,355 --> 00:04:33,856
that'll get you hurt.

50
00:04:35,375 --> 00:04:36,166
So?

51
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:39,112
Hey,

52
00:04:39,112 --> 00:04:41,030
we're supposed
to be a couple.

53
00:04:41,030 --> 00:04:43,783
You can't even fake it.

54
00:04:43,783 --> 00:04:46,536
How'll you
sell the romance?

55
00:04:49,163 --> 00:04:51,541
I'll act when it's time.

56
00:04:52,542 --> 00:04:54,377
I saw your viral video.

57
00:04:54,377 --> 00:04:57,213
And I knew
you'd never dated.

58
00:04:57,213 --> 00:04:58,506
You sure about that?

59
00:05:03,375 --> 00:05:04,583
(Elevator doors closing)

60
00:05:05,722 --> 00:05:08,182
Want a screen test?

61
00:05:12,729 --> 00:05:15,189
Good enough?
